# API

See also: `docs/006_API_SPEC.md`

## Conventions

- Base path: `/api`
- JSON in / JSON out
- Auth via Supabase session cookies / bearer
- Errors: `{ "error": { "code": string, "message": string } }`
- Lists support `page`, `pageSize`, `q`, `status`

## Implementation map

| Piece | Location |
|---|---|
| Contracts | `api/contracts.ts` |
| Handlers | `app/api/**/route.ts` |
| Services | `backend/services/**` |

## When adding an endpoint

1. Add/adjust contract in `api/contracts.ts`
2. Implement route handler with validation + authz
3. Delegate to a service (no fat handlers)
4. Update `docs/006_API_SPEC.md` if public surface changes

## Existing foundation

- `GET /api/health` → `backend/services/health.ts`
